<title>USA: Muni dealers traded $825 mln bonds Tuesday - MSRB.</title>
<headline>Muni dealers traded $825 mln bonds Tuesday - MSRB.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Municipal bond dealers traded $825.1 million of bonds Tuesday on 3,541 trades, the Municipal Securities Rulemaking Board said.</p>
<p>A total of 2,111 individual issues changed hands, with 91 of those trading four or more times, MSRB said, citing figures from an automated clearance system of interdealer trades.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
